 "note": "All 50 works have named commercial recordings. Fixes: SQ12 year (2009-10; Faber's 2011 is the premiere), Matthews PT1 minutes (19), notes for Matthews SQ10, Naxos Quartet 4 and Vespers, years for Mayer Op. 12 (1861 publication) and Mayseder Op. 12 (c. 1816), and years added for Maxwell Davies's String Quartet (1961), String Trio (2008), Oboe Quartet (2012) and Clarinet Quintet (2004). Naxos Quartet years left blank: Wikipedia's list is unreliable (No. 8). The Clarinet Quintet's only commercial recording found is the 2025 Paladino disc."
}